{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在结尾的自我接纳上不如X完整，X明确说出了即使始终等不到亲近的人，也愿意独自好好生活；Y更多强调将来遇见了要珍惜，少了这一层独立面对孤单的落点。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话语重点有明显的视觉层级，扫一眼加亮部分就能抓住每段发生了什么，感受又能随音乐出现，避免了X右侧大量短词同时堆积、彼此难以建立对应关系的问题。Y对音乐细节的描述也更具体，能让观众感受到情绪如何从一个瞬间变化到另一个瞬间；但X在人物动机、心理因果和最终如何安顿自己的交代上更完整，尤其结尾的自我接纳比Y更有说服力。综合看，Y更适合边听边看，X的叙事闭环则略胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b2b5592d-5088-4d68-a0a3-d944783c7904", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T071155785116Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:13:11.386433+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "11a6f9a0cfb80e35b56cffad01a5ccf08cbf0427b110c6d73c02a2a66ef2df55", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 